{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066008/block/singleImage/3279604/wm/01M8C6EBC8EMPCEDWJWEE8BYMM.jpg?updatedAt=1795705849\"/><figcaption>海怡半島站有女乘客暈倒。(資料圖片／鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>港鐵海怡半島站職員周四下午5時許報案指，一名歐姓38歲女子在南港島綫列車車廂內暈倒。人員接報到場後，把昏迷的事主送往瑪麗醫院搶救。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.442507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:10:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.756822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.861609+00:00","content_hash":"af994c6b26c7afc695e6969581ada0233db1804a02e3229f85d42f13a363fa42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.442507+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}